=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748400/extras/821b673e8ed3c596fe06e5ff8c2406ae.webm?t=1704824159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Up &amp; Play</h2>Elemental Engagements is a progressively-faster paced game on match by match basis. This means that most matches will last 5-20 minutes. The controls are designed specifically for the gamepad and split-screen gameplay, so RTS veterans and casual players alike will find tons of fun and room to strategize!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748400/extras/54546044566e17f7372f606c662cb42a.avif?t=1704824159\" width=620 height=200 /></span>",
